{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","鸣音禁制"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始前指定秩序，战斗开始时强制全体角色必须遵守一段时间；主动释放时，使秩序再次生效一段时间。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始前，顿里尔可以指定本场战斗中秩序钟的形态为“<sprite name=\"spui_oldgod_icon_1\">禁咒”或“<sprite name=\"spui_oldgod_icon_2\">抑生”之一。\n“<sprite name=\"spui_oldgod_icon_1\">禁咒”：无法使用终极技能。\n“<sprite name=\"spui_oldgod_icon_2\">抑生”：无法治疗其他角色。\n使用终极技能时，顿里尔使秩序钟降临，宣告指定的秩序并使双方非首领角色无条件服从，持续6 + 0.25秒。\n被动地，每次秩序钟降临时，会对所有敌人造成200% + 20% ATK伤害，且战斗开始时，秩序钟会立刻降临，持续12 + 0.5秒。\n顿里尔被击败后，秩序的生效时长衰减至剩余时间的30%。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":247,"end":254,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":282,"end":288,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":315,"end":321,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":278,"end":292,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至210% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至220% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至230% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至240% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","声若洪钟"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","对面前的敌人造成伤害，并根据指定的秩序附带额外的效果。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","发射音波，对面前3格宽、3格长的区域的敌人造成4段40% + 5% ATK伤害，秩序钟形态为“<sprite name=\"spui_oldgod_icon_1\">禁咒”时，额外降低敌人60点攻击速度，持续4秒；秩序钟形态为“<sprite name=\"spui_oldgod_icon_2\">抑生”时，额外附带敌人已损失生命值3%的伤害，该伤害最高不超过自身30%攻击力。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":33,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至45% + 5% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至50% + 5% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至55% + 5% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","守护音壁"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","每当满足指定的秩序所需的条件时，获得护盾。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","若秩序钟形态为“<sprite name=\"spui_oldgod_icon_1\">禁咒”，每当敌人释放终极技能时，顿里尔获得可以抵御130% + 20% ATK伤害的护盾，持续到战斗结束；若秩序钟形态为“<sprite name=\"spui_oldgod_icon_2\">抑生”，每当自身累计损失20%最大生命值时，获得可以抵御130% + 20% ATK伤害的护盾，持续到战斗结束。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":71,"end":77,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":169,"end":175,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":67,"end":81,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":165,"end":179,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","护盾抵御的伤害提升至140% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","护盾抵御的伤害提升至150% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","护盾抵御的伤害提升至160% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","自身受到的伤害降低。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的受到的伤害降低10%，秩序生效期间，自身受到的伤害额外降低5%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的受到的伤害降低12%，秩序生效期间，自身受到的伤害额外降低6%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的受到的伤害降低16%，秩序生效期间，自身受到的伤害额外降低8%。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","赦免之声"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","使得最远的一名友军不受到秩序的约束。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","顿里尔庇佑备战时离自身距离最远的非召唤物友军，使其不受到自身秩序的约束，直至其被击败。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","庇佑的角色攻击力提高2%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","庇佑的角色攻击力提高4%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","庇佑的角色急速提高20点。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","主动释放终极技能时，为友军提升攻击速度或生命汲取。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","主动使用终极技能时，若宣告“<sprite name=\"spui_oldgod_icon_1\">禁咒”秩序，还会使所有友军获得50点攻击速度，持续6秒；若宣告“<sprite name=\"spui_oldgod_icon_2\">抑生”秩序，还会使所有友军获得25点生命汲取，持续6秒。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每当秩序结束或被刷新时长时，若自身依然存活，则根据秩序钟形态触发额外效果：\n“<sprite name=\"spui_oldgod_icon_1\">禁咒”：所有敌人失去150点能量，并降低10点急速，持续8秒。\n“<sprite name=\"spui_oldgod_icon_2\">抑生”：所有敌人失去150% ATK生命值，并降低50点受愈，持续8秒。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":150,"end":158,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","旭辉洪钟"]]}